# University Management System

## Project Overview

This project implements a University Management System using PostgreSQL. It manages students, professors, courses, and enrollments while demonstrating database design and SQL analysis techniques.

## Technologies Used

* PostgreSQL
* SQL
* GitHub

## Database Tables

* Students
* Professors
* Courses
* Enrollments

## Features

* Student Management
* Course Management
* Professor Management
* Enrollment Tracking
* Student Performance Analysis

## SQL Concepts Demonstrated

* Primary Keys
* Foreign Keys
* Joins
* Aggregate Functions
* Window Functions
* Subqueries
* Views

## Analysis Performed

* Students by Department
* Average Grade by Course
* Top Performing Students
* Course Distribution
* Student Rankings

## Files

* university_management_system.sql – Complete database creation, data insertion, and analysis queries.

